NOTICE TO ALL TENANTS

Maintenance work on the east elevators will take place from Monday, May 5, through Wednesday, May 7. During this period, only the west elevators {{5}} in service. Tenants on floors 10 to 15 may experience longer waiting times, especially between 8:30 and 9:30 A.M. {{6}}

Deliveries that require an elevator should be scheduled for Thursday or later. {{7}}, if the work is completed early, we will post an update in the main lobby and send a message to each office manager. Building management thanks you for your {{8}} while the work is under way.
